{
  "_comment": "Each repo: GitHub slug, local folder under repos/ (or an absolute path), included directories (relative to the repo root), and repo-specific excluded paths (relative to the repo root; a directory excludes everything under it). Global exclusion rules (test/fixture/vendor/compiled dirs, *.d.ts, *.test.*, third-party license headers) live in collect-files.cjs. Repo-specific exclusions are files/dirs whose header states the whole file is vendored, generated, or derived from another project (reviewed by hand with show-flag-context.cjs).",
